{
  "source": "Prompts/work-with-ai-opener-1.mp4",
  "duration": 154.087625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.92,
      "text": "Getting good results requires intentional targeting."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.46,
      "end": 5.6,
      "text": "You must aim your request at a specific goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.26,
      "end": 8.78,
      "text": "Once the model generates an answer, your next step is verification."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.88,
      "end": 10.74,
      "text": "Fact checking is mandatory."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.68,
      "end": 13.6,
      "text": "Your relationship with the software is a collaboration,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.16,
      "end": 15.74,
      "text": "where you actively guide the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.3,
      "end": 18.52,
      "text": "It exists to multiply your analytical skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.48,
      "end": 23.52,
      "text": "Getting high-quality work out of an AI model is an active human-driven skill."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.1,
      "end": 26.7,
      "text": "When a prompt returns a generic or unhelpful response,"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.7,
      "end": 29.3,
      "text": "the immediate reaction is often to blame the application."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.1,
      "end": 33.38,
      "text": "However, observing different people operate the exact same system"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.38,
      "end": 36.12,
      "text": "reveals vastly different levels of quality in their results."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.1,
      "end": 37.64,
      "text": "Think about photography."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.6,
      "end": 40.34,
      "text": "Imagine two people standing in front of a sandwich,"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.64,
      "end": 41.56,
      "text": "holding identical smartphones."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.36,
      "end": 44.84,
      "text": "One person pulls their phone, taps the button while moving,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.06,
      "end": 47.08,
      "text": "and captures a rushed, out-of-focus picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.8,
      "end": 49.28,
      "text": "The other person squares their shoulders,"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.72,
      "end": 51.86,
      "text": "frames the subject carefully, adjusts the exposure,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.24,
      "end": 54.08,
      "text": "and captures a crisp, well-lit shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.08,
      "end": 55.98,
      "text": "The camera hardware never changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.68,
      "end": 59.38,
      "text": "The difference in the final image came entirely from the scale"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.38,
      "end": 61.2,
      "text": "and intent of the person holding the device."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.0,
      "end": 64.78,
      "text": "Generative AI operates by the exact same logic."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.52,
      "end": 68.7,
      "text": "The details and context you provide in your prompts are how you frame the shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.34,
      "end": 71.84,
      "text": "Treating the software like a magic oracle leads to failure."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.42,
      "end": 75.02,
      "text": "Success requires operating the system like an instrument"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.02,
      "end": 77.02,
      "text": "that depends on precise human direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.92,
      "end": 80.98,
      "text": "To build that skill, we have structured this section into a specific roadmap."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.84,
      "end": 83.02,
      "text": "First, know what it's for."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.02,
      "end": 86.18,
      "text": "Generative models operate differently than traditional software"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.18,
      "end": 88.22,
      "text": "like a spreadsheet or a word processor."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.84,
      "end": 92.52,
      "text": "We will break down how to identify which specific tasks are suited for an AI application"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.52,
      "end": 95.06,
      "text": "and which tasks require your direct handling."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.82,
      "end": 96.86,
      "text": "Second, use it well."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.52,
      "end": 100.26,
      "text": "We will look under the hood to see how a language model actually reads"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.26,
      "end": 101.82,
      "text": "and processes the text you submit."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.46,
      "end": 106.36,
      "text": "You will see exactly how adding specific constraints and context"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.36,
      "end": 108.88,
      "text": "directly improves the quality of the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.58,
      "end": 111.82,
      "text": "Third, think before you trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.82,
      "end": 115.32,
      "text": "This is the crucial final phase of handling the model's output."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.06,
      "end": 119.56,
      "text": "Because models generate plausible but sometimes incorrect information,"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.22,
      "end": 123.04,
      "text": "you must actively verify claims against credible sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.76,
      "end": 125.38,
      "text": "The software proposes an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.04,
      "end": 129.8,
      "text": "You remain the final judge of whether that work is accurate and ready to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.88,
      "end": 134.54,
      "text": "The quality of your final result depends directly on how deliberately"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.54,
      "end": 136.04,
      "text": "you apply these three steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.74,
      "end": 140.6,
      "text": "Going forward, your mandate is to treat AI as a collaborative partner."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.6,
      "end": 144.26,
      "text": "The software relies entirely on your direction to expand"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.26,
      "end": 145.98,
      "text": "and scale your original ideas."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.86,
      "end": 147.5,
      "text": "You know the framework."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.22,
      "end": 150.28,
      "text": "Now, it is time to take control of the instrument."
    }
  ],
